# Local data: everything in here is either YOURS or rebuildable.
#
#   user.sqlite     your decks, favourites, collection, cached prices
#   cards.sqlite    280 MB, built by build_db.py from Scryfall's bulk data
#   combos.sqlite   157 MB, built from Commander Spellbook's bulk file
#   edhrec/         cached commander pages
#   *.log           run logs
#
# sets.json is the exception: it is a small public list the line parser needs,
# so it ships with the repo and fetch_sets.py refreshes it.
data/*
!data/sets.json

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/

# Screenshots the browser checks leave behind (about 12 MB of them)
tests/*.png

# Editors and OS litter
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
